# Trading automation cron schedule
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# IMPORTANT: Server timezone must be US/Eastern (America/New_York).
#            setup.sh sets this automatically via timedatectl.
#
# Korea reference (KST = ET + 13h in EDT, +14h in EST):
#   9:35 AM ET  →  10:35 PM KST (EDT) / 11:35 PM KST (EST)  ← you're sleeping
#  12:30 PM ET  →   1:30 AM KST (next day)
#   4:05 PM ET  →   5:05 AM KST (next day)
#
# Placeholders substituted by setup.sh:
#   __REPO_DIR__  __APP_DIR__  __PYTHON__  __LOG_DIR__
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

# ── Market open: run screener + place new spread orders (9:35 AM ET Mon–Fri)
35 9 * * 1-5 bash __REPO_DIR__/deploy/run_entry.sh >> __LOG_DIR__/cron.log 2>&1

# ── Midday: check profit targets / DTE triggers (12:30 PM ET Mon–Fri)
30 12 * * 1-5 bash __REPO_DIR__/deploy/run_monitor.sh >> __LOG_DIR__/cron.log 2>&1

# ── Post-close: final position scan before overnight (4:05 PM ET Mon–Fri)
5 16 * * 1-5 bash __REPO_DIR__/deploy/run_monitor.sh >> __LOG_DIR__/cron.log 2>&1
